This file was used as a development/in-progress working copy and contains
local-development fallbacks (DEV_MODE, local fake users, sqlite fallbacks).

It has been replaced in the main application with production-safe logic.
Keep this file only for historical reference; remove before creating a
production artifact. For deployments, run the application via the main
module at `backend/backend/app/main.py` and ensure `DATABASE_URL` is set.
